      "writtenOn": "2022-12-16T12:49:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This section is for warning _disables_. We already set `-Wall` _and_ `-Weverything` above. I don\u0027t think you need to add anything--just remove the flag-disables and you\u0027re good to go.",
